🦊🥁 The Jackal and the Drum (Raw Story)

Once upon a time, a hungry jackal was wandering in a forest.

He had not eaten for many days and was very weak.

As he walked, he suddenly heard a loud sound.

“Dum! Dum! Dum!”

The jackal became frightened.

“What is that noise?” he thought.

“Maybe it is a dangerous animal!”

But he was also very hungry.

So he slowly walked toward the sound.

Soon, he found a big drum lying near a tree.

The wind was blowing, and the branches were hitting the drum, making the loud noise.

The jackal felt relieved.

“Oh! It’s just a drum,” he said.

He jumped on it and tore it open.

But inside, there was nothing to eat.

The jackal laughed at himself.

“I was scared for no reason,” he said.

💖 Moral:

Do not be afraid without understanding the truth.
